WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.004 --> 00:00:04.998
Set up your author website

2
00:00:05.505 --> 00:00:10.458
Every studio comes with a free author website. Set it up on the Website page.

3
00:00:10.461 --> 00:00:17.539
Your site lives at yourname.jollofpages.com. You can also connect a domain of your own.

4
00:00:17.541 --> 00:00:23.080
Name the site, add a tagline and choose which book leads the home page.

5
00:00:23.083 --> 00:00:29.468
Write a short about page and add links to your social profiles.

6
00:00:29.471 --> 00:00:34.846
Then Open the site to see it as readers do.
